---
import FigureViewport from './FigureViewport.astro';
import { createRequire } from 'node:module';
const rootRequire = createRequire(new URL('../../../package.json', import.meta.url));
const katex = createRequire(rootRequire.resolve('rehype-katex'))('katex');
const labels = [
  {x:262,y:155,w:58,t:'\\operatorname{Re}k'},
  {x:122,y:0,w:68,t:'\\operatorname{Im}k'},
  {x:26,y:191,w:48,t:'-R'}, {x:238,y:191,w:48,t:'R'},
  {x:136,y:191,w:40,t:'0'},
  {x:222,y:38,w:85,t:'y<x'},
];
---
<figure id="kdv-transmission-contour" class="kdv-contour" aria-labelledby="kdv-contour-caption">
  <FigureViewport width={320}><svg viewBox="0 0 320 229" role="img" aria-labelledby="kdv-contour-title kdv-contour-desc">
    <title id="kdv-contour-title">Upper half-plane contour</title>
    <desc id="kdv-contour-desc">The real segment runs from minus R to R; the upper arc returns from R to minus R counterclockwise. A small clockwise upper semicircle avoids the origin. The contour does not specify pole locations. The exponential decays above the real line when y is less than x.</desc>
    <defs><marker id="kdv-contour-arrow" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" refX="5" refY="3.5" orient="auto"><path d="M0,0 L7,3.5 L0,7 Z" fill="var(--accent)" /></marker><marker id="kdv-axis-arrow" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" refX="5" refY="3" orient="auto"><path d="M0,0 L6,3 L0,6 Z" fill="var(--muted)" /></marker></defs>
    <path d="M50 184 H146 A10 10 0 0 1 166 184 H262 A106 106 0 0 0 50 184 Z" fill="var(--accent)" opacity=".055" />
    {['M15 184 H306','M156 204 V32'].map(d=><path d={d} fill="none" stroke="var(--muted)" stroke-width="1.2" marker-end="url(#kdv-axis-arrow)" />)}
    <path d="M50 184 H146 A10 10 0 0 1 166 184 H262 A106 106 0 0 0 50 184" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="3" />
    {['M85 184 H115','M225 184 H245','M226 105 A106 106 0 0 0 190 83','M70 122 A106 106 0 0 0 56 149'].map(d=><path d={d} fill="none" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="3" marker-end="url(#kdv-contour-arrow)" />)}
    {labels.map(l => <foreignObject x={l.x} y={l.y} width={l.w} height="31"><div class="tex-label" set:html={katex.renderToString(l.t,{throwOnError:true})}/></foreignObject>)}
  </svg></FigureViewport>
  <div class="kdv-contour-decay" set:html={katex.renderToString('|e^{ik(x-y)}|=e^{-\\operatorname{Im}k(x-y)}',{throwOnError:true})} />
  <figcaption id="kdv-contour-caption">実軸を左から右へ進み、大きな上半円で戻る正向きの積分路。原点は小さな上半円で避ける。指数因子の減衰により、大半円の寄与は消える。</figcaption>
</figure>
<style>
.kdv-contour { scroll-margin-top:80px; margin:2rem 0; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:12px; padding:1rem; background:var(--paper); }
.kdv-contour svg { display:block; width:320px; margin:0 auto; height:auto; overflow:visible; }
.tex-label { color:var(--ink); font-size:20px; line-height:1.5; text-align:center; white-space:nowrap; }
.kdv-contour-decay {text-align:center;color:var(--ink);font-size:.95rem;white-space:nowrap;margin:.25rem 0 .75rem;}
.kdv-contour figcaption { color:var(--muted); font-size:.88rem; line-height:1.8; margin-top:.5rem; }
@media(max-width:480px){.kdv-contour{padding:.6rem .15rem}.tex-label{font-size:20px}}
</style>
